<section class="story-section toy-section" id="play">
  <p class="eyebrow">03 / Play with it</p>
  <h2>Two labels.<br />More than two words.</h2><Discovery slug="pretraining" />
  <p>Try zero labels, then two, then eight. When does reading help most?</p>
  <noscript><p>Enable JavaScript to try the toy. Reading groups adjectives by the words that follow them. A few review labels can then teach a rating for a whole group.</p></noscript>
